# Root allowlist: source, preview, build metadata and public documentation only.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
!/PackageVersions.props
!/*.slnx
!/src/
!/src/**
!/design/
/design/*
!/design/PreviewHost/
!/design/PreviewHost/**
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/USAGE.en.md
!/docs/USAGE.zh-cn.md
!/docs/DEVELOPMENT.md
!/docs/PUBLISHING.md
!/docs/PRINTING-PRINCIPLES.zh-cn.md
!/docs/PDFium-LICENSE.txt

# Build output, packages and local tooling (also under allowed source directories).
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.preview/
**/artifacts/
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.agents/
**/.agent/
**/.skills/
**/.codex/
**/.claude/
**/AGENTS.md
**/AGENT.md
**/SKILL.md
**/.DS_Store
*.user
*.suo
*.log
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
